ally rent an apartment.\n\n7.**The monthly rent at the Olive Garden is $2000**: This provides the rent amount for the Olive Garden.\n\n8.**Tom will rent an apartment in a managed building if and only if he is allowed to move in with Fluffy, and the security deposit is no more than $1500**: This is the key condition that Tom must meet to rent an apartment in a managed building with Fluffy.\n\nGiven these points, let\'s break down the conditions:\n- Tom needs to be allowed to move in with Fluffy.\nTom is not allowed to move in an apartment in The Olive Garden with Fluffy.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
