and Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\nCoco Gauff is not among the most active players in major tennis.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
