gn and evocative.\n- However, the statement does not provide any information about whether a design by Max is timeless or not.\n\nGiven this, we cannot definitively conclude whether a design by Max is a mass product design or not. The information provided does not give us enough details to determine the timelessness of a design by Max.\n\nTherefore, the statement "A design by Max is not a mass product design" is uncertain.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
