hose Mondays is not the Bachelor.\nTherefore, the show on TV at 8 pm on those Mondays is not the Bachelor.\nEvaluating the Statement:\nThe statement "Breaking Bad is on Monday at 8 pm" is directly supported by the information that the show on TV at 8 pm on those Mondays is not the Bachelor.\nSince the Bachelor is not Breaking Bad, the statement must be true.\nConclusion:\nBased on the given context, the statement "Breaking Bad is on Monday at 8 pm" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
