2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Therefore, all female players at Roland Garros 2022 are among the most active players in major tennis.\n   - Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (from the given information).\n\n3.**Analyze the Statement:**\n   - The statement to evaluate is: "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis."\n   - We need to determine if Coco Gauff lost to Iga Świątek or is among the most active players in major tennis.\n\nCoco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
