rom the given information).\n   - If Ben is loved by children, then Ben is funny (from the given information).\n   - If Ben is funny, then Ben is popular (from the given information).\nSince Ben can be neither yellow nor ugly, the statement "Ben is either yellow and ugly or neither yellow nor ugly" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
