messages:   78%|#######7  | 159/204 [04:41<00:49,  1.11s/it][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nOn some Mondays at 8 pm, roses are given out on TV. Every rose given out on TV is on the Bachelor. Everything on the Bachelor portrays the lives of real people. All shows portraying the lives of real people are reality TV shows. Breaking Bad is not a reality TV show.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Breaking Bad is a TV show in which roses are given out on Monday at 8 pm.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', '<think>.\nTo determine whether the statement "Breaking Bad is a TV show in which roses are given out on Monday at 8 pm" is true, false, or uncertain, we need to analyze the given context step by step and see if we can logically deduce the truth of the statement.\n\n1.**Context Analysis:**.\n   - On some Mondays at 8 pm, roses are given out on TV.\n   - Every rose given out on TV is on the Bachelor.\n   - Everything on the Bachelor portrays the lives of real people.\n   - All shows portraying the lives of real people are reality TV shows.\n   - Breaking Bad is not a reality TV show.\n\n2.**Breaking Down the Statements:**.\n   - Roses are given out on TV on some Mondays at 8 pm.\n   - These roses are on the Bachelor.\n   - The Bachelor portrays the lives of real people.\n   - All shows portraying the lives of real people are reality TV shows.\n   - Breaking Bad is not a reality TV show.\n\n3.**Connecting the Statements:**.\n   - Since roses are given out on TV on some Mondays at 8 pm and these roses are on the Bachelor, it means that the Bachelor is on TV on some Mondays at 8 pm.\n   - The Bachelor portrays the lives of real people.\n   - Therefore, the Bachelor is a reality TV show (since all shows portraying the lives of real people are reality TV shows).\n   - However, we know that Breaking Bad is not a reality TV show.Based on the information provided, it is clear that on Breaking Bad, roses are never given out on Monday at 8 pm. Therefore, the statement is definitely true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
