ion provided, we know the mine is not located in the Picuris Mountains, which are in New Mexico.\n\nGiven this reasoning, the statement is true because the Harding Pegmatite Mine is not located in a mountain range (the Picuris Mountains) in New Mexico.\n\n\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
